-- =========================================================================
-- PHP (Partial Hospitalization Program) demo data for the Clinical Co-Pilot
-- GENERATED by contrib/util/generate_php_demo_data.py — edit that, not this.
-- Re-runnable: deletes and re-inserts its own ID ranges (pids 100-129 etc).
